ar sense of high-stakes action and suspense.\\n\\nThese movies offer a mix of epic action, stunning visuals, and grand narratives that fans of Avengers: Endgame tend to enjoy. I hope you find something that piques your interest! '}, {'role': 'user', 'content': \"I've already seen some of these movies, but I'm interested in exploring more options. You mentioned Edge of Tomorrow, which I think has a similar sense of urgency and action to Avengers: Endgame. Can you recommend more movies that have a similar blend of sci-fi and action elements? \"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': \"Edge of Tomorrow is an excellent choice! If you enjoyed its blend of sci-fi and action, here are some more recommendations that you might enjoy:\\n\\n1. **Source Code** (2011) - This sci-fi thriller, also starring Jake Gyllenhaal, features a similar time-looping concept, where a soldier relives the same day to prevent a terrorist attack.\\n2. **Looper** (2012) - This time-travel action film, starring Joseph Gordon-Levitt and Bruce Willis, explores the consequences of altering the timeline, with a similar sense of urgency and action.\\n3. **The Tomorrow War** (2020) - This sci-fi action film, starring Chris Pratt, features a similar blend of time travel and action, as a group of soldiers are sent to the future to fight an alien invasion.\\n4. **Oblivion** (2013) - This post-apocalyptic sci-fi film, starring Tom Cruise, features a similar sense of action and exploration, as a repairman discovers a hidden truth about the world's fate.\\n5. **Elysium** (2013) - This sci-fi action film, starring Matt Damon and Jodie Foster, explores a dystopian future where the wealthy live in a utopian paradise, and the rest of humanity fights for survival.\\n6. **Chappie** (2015) - This sci-fi film, directed by Neill Blomkamp, features a similar blend of action and social commentary, as a police robot gains consciousness and begins to question its purpose.\\n7. **RoboCop** (2014) - This remake of the classic sc